FORWARDING NOTICE — this file is no longer the durable record.

The seL4 kernel change (ledger row 27 — a DEVICE untyped keeps its free
index when its last child is deleted, and the high-MMIO device-untyped
ladder becomes a uniform 64 GiB grid) lives IN the Genode fork as a
port patch file:

    genode/repos/base-sel4/patches/sel4-device-untyped-ladder.patch
    (fork: github.com/llaa33219/sponge-os-genode, `repos/base-sel4/patches/`)

`sel4.port` feeds `PATCHES := $(sort $(wildcard $(REP_DIR)/patches/*.patch))`
into `install.mk`, which applies each file with `patch -p0` during
`prepare_port sel4`. Nothing has to be applied by hand and nothing is
lost when `genode/contrib/` is re-fetched.

The patch carries two hunks:

  * `src/kernel/sel4/src/object/untyped.c` — the retype path keeps a
    device untyped's free index (its watermark) when the untyped has
    no live child, instead of resetting it to the untyped's base. The
    reset is what silently moved every frame created from a device
    untyped back to the untyped's base, so a device BAR in the middle
    of the untyped was mapped to the wrong physical address and the
    driver read zeroes (the LG gram 17ZD90N's xHCI BAR at
    0x601d140000: "Host halt failed, -110").

  * `src/kernel/sel4/src/kernel/boot.c` — `create_untypeds_for_region()`
    grows a `max_size_bits` parameter, and the HIGH device region
    above the memory map is covered by a uniform grid of 64 GiB device
    untypeds (the doubling ladder only fills the gap between the
    memory map and the first grid point). One free index per untyped
    means two device windows inside the same untyped can only be
    placed in increasing address order; the grid gives the gram's GOP
    framebuffer (256 GiB) and its xHCI BAR (384.9 GiB) independent
    untypeds, so their order no longer matters.

To read or edit the change, open the fork file above. To see the diff
against a prepared tree:

    diff -u genode/contrib/sel4-*/<file> <(patch -R -o - -p0 < \
        genode/repos/base-sel4/patches/sel4-device-untyped-ladder.patch)

Drop condition: unchanged from ledger row 27.
